abstract: >-
  Readable, validated Python for an undergraduate course in separation processes - vapour-liquid
  equilibrium and azeotropes, flash, distillation (McCabe-Thiele, shortcut, multicomponent, batch),
  absorption and packed towers, extraction and leaching, adsorption and fixed beds, membranes,
  crystallization, drying and evaporation - checked against analytic solutions and published data, with an
  18-notebook course and worked solutions.
